* Comparator, for low-swing input clock signals
* Specifications, with Cload= 50fF,  Vinp-Vinn=200mV@vdd/2, 1ns input transition time      
*          Min   Typ   Max                    
* Vhyst    10    19    30    mV
* delay          2.8   4     ns
* Idd      200   441   700   uA    Ibias=9uA
* Iddq(pd) 0    <0.01  0.1   uA
 
* in/out nodes
* ibias  : 7~19 uA bias current in from VDD
* inn    : inverting input
* inp    : non-inverting input
* out    : digital output
* pd     : power-down digital input, active high
* xpd    : pd-inverted digital input
* vdda   : 3.3 VDC, power in 
* vssa   : ground
*.subckt COMP1 ibias inn inp out pd xpd vdda vssa 

X1 ibias inn inp out pd xpd vdda 0 COMP1

.TEMP 27
.param vddmin=3.0 vddnom=3.3 vddmax=3.6
.param vddi=3.3

Cload out   0  50e-15

Rbias ibias vdda 300k

VDD   vdda  0   3.3

* Test description
* apply VDD/2=1.65 to one input, slowly ramp the other input from VDDnom/2-0.5 to VDDnom/2+0.5, and then down, and measure when it switches
* measure Iddq when both inputs at mid-rail
* then apply fast input, and measure delay

Vpd  pd   0 pwl(0,       3.3,
+               1n,      0)
Vxpd xpd  0 pwl(0,       0,
+               1n,      3.3)

Vref inn  0 pwl(0,       1.65,
+               20u,     1.65,
+               21u,     1.75,
+               21.001u, 1.55,
+               22.000u, 1.55,
+               22.001u, 1.75)

Vin  inp  0 pwl(0,       1.55,      
+               10u,     1.75,  
+               20u,     1.55,  
+               21u,     1.55,  
+               21.001u, 1.75, 
+               22.000u, 1.75,
+               22.001u, 1.55) 

.MEAS  risehyst  FIND  v(inp) WHEN v(out) val=1.65 td=1u     
.MEAS  fallhyst  FIND  v(inp) WHEN v(out) val=1.65 td=10u    
.MEAS  risedelay TRIG  v(inp) val=1.65 td=21u  TARG  v(out) val=1.65  
.MEAS  falldelay TRIG  v(inp) val=1.65 td=22u  TARG  v(out) val=1.65  
.MEAS  Vhyst     PARAM 'risehyst-fallhyst'
.MEAS  delay     PARAM max(risedelay, falldelay)
.MEAS  Idd       FIND  i(VDD)  at=5u
.MEAS  Iddq      FIND  i(VDD)  at=0

.INCLUDE subcircuit_files/COMP1.sub
.INCLUDE subcircuit_files/PRIMITIVE.sub

*.INCLUDE process_models/fastN_fastP.process
*.INCLUDE process_models/slowN_fastP.process
.INCLUDE process_models/typical.process
*.INCLUDE process_models/fastN_slowP.process
*.INCLUDE process_models/slowN_slowP.process
.TRAN 1u 23u 0.000000
.END

